 AskForNumberWithRange;parms
 parms←##.GUI.Request.CreateParmsForNumber
 parms.valueRange←1 10
 #.⎕SHADOW'OnOkayInAskForNumberWithRange'
 parms.onOkay←'#.OnOkayInAskForNumberWithRange'
 #.OnOkayInAskForNumberWithRange←{
     n←⍵
     n.∆result<4:1
     msg←'The number (',(⍕n.∆result),') is unusually high - are you aure?'
     ##.GUI.Dialogs.YesOrNo msg
 }
 ⎕←parms ##.GUI.Request.AskForNumber'Number of copies:'
⍝Done
